{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furry Empire is a match-three adventure blended with visual novel storytelling, where you \u2694\ufe0f battle enemies, \u2b06\ufe0f upgrade your abilities, and \ud83d\udc95 build romantic relationships with sexy furry girls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029550/extras/4a33d0f60a596875ad3c6dc0d2226d0c.poster.avif?t=1770997174\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029550/extras/4a33d0f60a596875ad3c6dc0d2226d0c.webm?t=1770997174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029550/extras/4a33d0f60a596875ad3c6dc0d2226d0c.mp4?t=1770997174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take on the role of a young emperor \ud83d\udc51 who has just received this title. Unfortunately, he doesn't have much time to enjoy it - the Demon King is gathering forces to destroy the world, so our hero needs a bigger army \ud83d\udee1, more resources \ud83d\udcb0 and more power \u26a1\ufe0f.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get everything he needs, our hero must defeat the four &quot;Queens of the North&quot; to get their armies and resources. And that's where our story begins! \u2728\ud83d\udcd6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029550/extras/a4e84526ebcfb8a5ed64a273cf6c5cc7.avif?t=1770997174\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ember, the Sword of Wildfire\u00a0\ud83d\udd25 - a powerful warrior who likes nothing but drinking, fighting and eating. She will crush you before you can make your first move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029550/extras/0ddc2a854f0059721ece80cf28f42149.avif?t=1770997174\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lapis, Lady of Magic \ud83d\udfea\u00a0- a shy beauty of the dragon race who, like you, has only recently gained her position. Despite her inexperience in all things social, she is one of the most powerful mages today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029550/extras/808490efb292a0ec84df8846dc8af62f.avif?t=1770997174\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eyre, the Master of All Winds\u00a0\ud83d\udca8 - a cunning and playful archer. No one can catch her or keep up with her speed, but she never runs and always plays with her opponents before killing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029550/extras/6f32a29129f5b5e4d57a0e3797558294.avif?t=1770997174\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Icelyn, the Cold Wisdom\u00a0\u2744\ufe0f - a true leader of her nation, the wisest person in the whole empire. Like her powers, her character is very cold, you'd be lucky to see her smile. If you try to approach her without permission - your body will be immediately imprisoned in ice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029550/extras/a03a9890cd2834e26269e40b463a2e8d.poster.avif?t=1770997174\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029550/extras/a03a9890cd2834e26269e40b463a2e8d.webm?t=1770997174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029550/extras/a03a9890cd2834e26269e40b463a2e8d.mp4?t=1770997174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Queens of the North are eager to test your strength \u2694\ufe0f (and perhaps your charm \ud83d\ude09). Prove yourself in battle three times, and they will surrender their armies \ud83d\udee1, their kingdoms \ud83c\udff0, and themselves to your rule \ud83d\udc51. So what are you waiting for? \u2728</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3029550?t=1770997174","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3029550?t=1770997174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029550/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770997174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029550/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770997174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Nudity and Sexual Content which is not suitable for all audiences. Full frontal nudity, sex acts.\r\n\r\nAll characters involved in sexual content are over the age of 18."},"demos":[{"appid":4076850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furry Empire is a match-three adventure blended with visual novel storytelling, where you \u2694\ufe0f battle enemies, \u2b06\ufe0f upgrade your abilities, and \ud83d\udc95 build romantic relationships with sexy furry girls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >